From b1e4af66c4e37100ed68a1cbd6f8b17f035aa644 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:41:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Agency dashboard v2: real clients (CRM), tasks & agenda,
 quotes & invoices; aligned 12-column grid; open sign-up for the first 30

- Clients: records, monthly fee, status, notes, live website check, per-client tasks/meetings/documents
- Tasks & agenda: tasks per client, meetings, follow-ups and invoices due in one agenda
- Quotes & invoices: auto-numbered, line items + VAT, statuses, quote to invoice, PDF via print, email draft
- Pipeline: 'Make client' turns a won prospect into a client
- Dashboard: only real blocks (prospects, pipeline, tasks, agenda, clients, revenue), rows share one height; old layouts reset once
- Sidebar without the old analytics switcher, alerts and AI button
- Sign-up open while beta seats remain (BETA_SEATS, default 30), then waitlist; no example data

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
